  "details": "## Description\n\nIf you go to a high ping instance you can place duplicated items if you are fast enough, because the item takes a bit to spawn.\n\n## Reproduction\n\n1. Go to an instance with high ping (tested on 280 ping, EU->JP).\n\n2. Place item, quickly place another one before the first one spawns.\n\nAttached a video.",
